            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DesertBloom"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent. To make it healthier, I add a couple of handful of baby spinach and liquify it in the (almond) milk or water completely. Then add frozen banana, peanut butter and blend ingredients. You will not taste the spinach!",
            "datePublished": "2020-07-27T14:26:23.717Z"
          },
